// An auto job child drops inherited sockets.
// The peer reply is not held until that job ends.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE fin ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law ROLE nanobot PROTON 1

PLUG fin law

IMPULSE fin 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "fin" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
